{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f26399f68bff408e4863bfb9d41147aec62e3acf1c2d56c08383547c50dbcc15", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n『パジャマパーティー』がテーマの撮影なのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n拍摄主题是“睡衣派对”，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2f94bc6c4b1a257aee971347e9a8ef411cc3ec488ea3ca56e1b891fc49bf605f", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしよう～！\nアタシ、もうダメかもしれないよ～！？", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办啊～！\n我、我可能已经不行了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "79262a3306ab7bbff5e9d6b04937a9c4933b83d601ce91f96b3f0223d39a7c71", "ja": "ええっ！？\nえっと……どうしたんだ？　何かあったのか？", "zh": "诶！？\n那个……怎么了？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8f3b1b4573259abc54844529997a52223ce663b03a0bc3c2530bdf50791f954c", "ja": "どうしたもこうしたも……\n今日のテーマって、パジャマパーティーだよね！？", "zh": "哪有什么怎么了……\n今天的主题是睡衣派对，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0266812597649196d5892293269ff3bd61f4ca78a9bca02c94a75a9d33b9e0cc", "ja": "さっき見ちゃったんだけどさ……撮影で使う小物に\nジュースとかケーキとかあったんだよ～！", "zh": "我刚才看到了……拍摄要用的道具里，\n居然有果汁、蛋糕之类的东西啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "292f317aadf5ed38ae07362bf73007e3d3a574355339f2bdfe4fc4a98cae5bcf", "ja": "そんなのアタシ、\n絶対衣装を汚しちゃうに決まってるじゃん！", "zh": "那种东西，我肯定会把服装弄脏的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2c8b8b0b62b7ee7d022f3c329a080255d598ffc87495136e845ee3980ad23ee6", "ja": "……変なところに自信を持ってるな。でも汚すと\n思うなら、実際に食べたり飲んだりしなきゃ……。", "zh": "……你在这奇怪的地方倒是挺有自信的。不过既然\n觉得会弄脏，只要不真的去吃或者喝的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a23aa691af95f6a3a5bc9c199b427921fc90b7f9c3eb9d36086b5a0fe9882b46", "ja": "そうだけどー！　アタシ、\nどっちかって言うと落ち着きとかない方だし……。", "zh": "是这样没错——！我、我本来就属于比较坐不住的那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c2ae499b4b46d4bc5b64b790cebca2135a09eba8e705543f47725a3dfbe80454", "ja": "撮影中にテンションが上がって、\n飲み物とか倒しちゃったりしたら……ヒィッ～！？", "zh": "要是在拍摄时一兴奋，把饮料什么的碰倒了……咿——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0f84f1da053f94c5881563478092e6bc11c8c19acbebcdf664aaf99a9c8fb4c0", "ja": "うーん……\nでも写真に臨場感が出るなら、それくらい……。", "zh": "嗯……\n不过要是能让照片更有临场感，那样也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "889bfd320b52dbe60f591be2cd65ecf1a286cfe22f8349bc27ccc1c7814bf35d", "ja": "そういう問題じゃないってば～！\nだって、このパジャマ……シルクだよ？", "zh": "不是那种问题啦～！\n因为这件睡衣……可是丝绸的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb667668555189d2ac1124bac77b207c999b68f6eff06687901fde0e547d0603", "ja": "アタシのせいで、お高いパジャマが汚れたら……\nざ、罪悪感が……うう～、マイガーッ！", "zh": "要是因为我，把这么贵的睡衣弄脏了……\n罪、罪恶感……呜呜～，天哪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55fcf456ac0e7dca77ea5a85fdfcb4643eb9b0542416bb44c96b3ff4a0ca60f5", "ja": "歩……。そのパジャマは、歩のために用意したものだ。\n汚さないように気をつけてくれるのも嬉しい。", "zh": "阿步……那套睡衣是专门为阿步准备的。\n你会注意不把它弄脏，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1013_p", "source_sha256": "64071bf248ea0eda5023d1c5ea32f2f719bec858e3c59f794ec0934a5396abb6", "ja": "でもそのせいで、心から撮影を楽しめないのは違うと\n思う。歩らしい写真をみんな楽しみにしてるからね。", "zh": "不过，要是因为这个而无法发自内心地享受拍摄，我觉得就不对了。大家都期待着拍出步的风格的照片呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "287bc8f72f77da5830cd59998968a32155d9cdaddf0a0e084c4da931f0bd2557", "ja": "{$P$}……。そうだね。\nみんな、アタシらしいパーティーの写真がみたいよね。", "zh": "{$P$}……是啊。\n大家都想看看符合我风格的派对照片，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e8a8e1732ffd5b2984ac28f2db17e1625b5dd935815c4e116e9b2e66e49a9b4e", "ja": "よーし、アタシらしく全力で楽しむぞ～！\n……でも汚しちゃったら、ごめんね♪", "zh": "好～，那我就按自己的风格全力享受啦～！\n……不过要是弄脏了，可别怪我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0483_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d31cd9f2e9d8a76850b233d32937c0270a805d831604ac4b88308f6c4c5b70b0", "ja": "（ジュースやケーキを食べてリラックスしたのか、\n歩らしい楽しそうな一枚が撮れた！）", "zh": "可能是吃了果汁和蛋糕放松下来，拍到了一张很有步风格、充满欢乐的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
